DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbsswwaapp1166(), bbsswwaapp3322(), and bbsswwaapp6644() functions return a byte order
     swapped integer.  On big endian systems, the number is converted to lit‐
     tle endian byte order.  On little endian systems, the number is converted
     to big endian byte order.

     The bbee1166ttoohh(), bbee3322ttoohh(), and bbee6644ttoohh() functions return a big endian
     byte ordered integer converted to the system's native byte order.  The
     return value will be the same as the argument on big endian systems.

     The llee1166ttoohh(), llee3322ttoohh(), and llee6644ttoohh() functions return a little endian
     byte ordered integer converted to the system's native byte order.  The
     return value will be the same as the argument on little endian systems.

     The hhttoobbee1166(), hhttoobbee3322(), and hhttoobbee6644() functions return an integer in
     the system's native byte order converted to big endian byte order.  The
     return value will be the same as the argument on big endian systems.

     The hhttoollee1166(), hhttoollee3322(), and hhttoollee6644() functions return a integer in the
     system's native byte order converted to little endian byte order.  The
     return value will be the same as the argument on little endian systems.

     The bbee1166eenncc(), bbee1166ddeecc(), bbee3322eenncc(), bbee3322ddeecc(), bbee6644eenncc(), bbee6644ddeecc(),
     llee1166eenncc(), llee1166ddeecc(), llee3322eenncc(), llee3322ddeecc(), llee6644eenncc(), and llee6644ddeecc()
     functions encode and decode integers to/from byte strings on any align‐
     ment in big/little endian format.

